            {
                "entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                "word": "MOOC",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9a93f495-b730-46be-bde7-e7036351fd9f",
                        "entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "MOOCs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "70bc2af2-f4f1-340b-b7fc-1b52afd9735c",
                        "entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Formation qui vise un grand nombre de personnes et se réalise à distance via Internet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db6e4a9f-6d14-4c77-ac63-2df3ba8570fb",
                                "sense_id": "70bc2af2-f4f1-340b-b7fc-1b52afd9735c",
                                "text": "Dans le cadre de l’École du Chanvre, on est en train de monter ce qu’on appelle un MOOC, c’est-à-dire de la formation à distance ouverte à tous où les particuliers pourront s’inscrire, les architectes, les bureaux d’étude et l’idée c’est de former en quatre semaines les professionnels à la culture de la construction au chanvre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28abe764-0716-4fd2-a5a1-9cf519b74988",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                        "source_sense_id": "70bc2af2-f4f1-340b-b7fc-1b52afd9735c",
                        "target_lang_word": "MOOC",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "MOOC",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "950ffb08-043d-357f-811c-106b42fd3b4f",
                                        "entry_id": "cb1b4d4d-c61f-3fc6-8235-f3f55003d787",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "spezielle Form von universitären, internetbasierten Onlinekursen mit sehr vielen Teilnehmern"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2e0d4e0-f371-4d1d-89e8-2103dc9ef54b",
                                                "sense_id": "950ffb08-043d-357f-811c-106b42fd3b4f",
                                                "text": "„Ihren ersten MOOC (Massive Open Online Course) hat die Fernuniversität in Hagen ab dem 29. April für die Dauer von vier Wochen in Form eines „Interdisziplinären Diskurses zur digitalen Gesellschaft“ […] angeboten. […] MOOCs werden bereits von Hochschulen, Institutionen und Unternehmen weltweit eingesetzt. Nicht immer erfolgreich. […] Deshalb war dieser erste MOOC der FernUniversität ein Angebot für unsere Hauptzielgruppe - für die rund 84.000 Studierenden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e40002f-339c-48be-9598-7767151bba97",
                                                "sense_id": "950ffb08-043d-357f-811c-106b42fd3b4f",
                                                "text": "Der MOOC „Web-Technologien“ des Hasso-Plattner-Institutes an der Universität Potsdam hat ein sehr hohes Niveau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7d6a854-10ef-49e1-84dd-d3c51d794471",
                                                "sense_id": "950ffb08-043d-357f-811c-106b42fd3b4f",
                                                "text": "Auch die LMU-München bietet neuerdings MOOCs an."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ca8927c-eea5-4df9-903c-ad163b0d5059",
                                                "sense_id": "950ffb08-043d-357f-811c-106b42fd3b4f",
                                                "text": "Über MOOCs kann ich endlich am MIT oder in Harvard studieren."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce06337c-58ea-43c6-b148-5e16351937f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                        "source_sense_id": "70bc2af2-f4f1-340b-b7fc-1b52afd9735c",
                        "target_lang_word": "MOOC",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "MOOC",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc04f7ce-62e5-3443-9bb7-287db1c931d6",
                                        "entry_id": "d547e279-4a00-3d85-9653-412bd75dc25b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acronym of massive open online course; a course designed for a very large enrollment, offered on the World Wide Web by an educational institution and typically free of charge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "acronym",
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7ffa8b8-7c94-4ce7-8365-83b4dd33827d",
                                                "sense_id": "dc04f7ce-62e5-3443-9bb7-287db1c931d6",
                                                "text": "In some ways, how learning and sharing works in a MOOC is more akin to a social network than to a traditional classroom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7c74aa5-0d35-4bdf-93e9-84e39564cfd2",
                                                "sense_id": "dc04f7ce-62e5-3443-9bb7-287db1c931d6",
                                                "text": "Besides the Artificial Intelligence course, Stanford offered two other MOOCs last semester — Machine Learning (104,000 registered, and 13,000 completed the course), and Introduction to Databases (92,000 registered, 7,000 completed)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c79211f-531f-4562-9d91-11118b8147cb",
                                                "sense_id": "dc04f7ce-62e5-3443-9bb7-287db1c931d6",
                                                "text": "With MOOCs offered by the most renowned professors in their respective fields, students have less incentive to relocate for postsecondary education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbda2aba-5209-4b99-8445-aa645aa97a9b",
                                                "sense_id": "dc04f7ce-62e5-3443-9bb7-287db1c931d6",
                                                "text": "Besides providing online courses to their own (generally fee-paying) students, universities have felt obliged to join the MOOC revolution to avoid being guillotined by it. […] Led by the Open University, which pioneered distance-learning in the 1970s, FutureLearn, a consortium of 21 British, one Irish and one Australian university, plus other educational bodies, will start offering MOOCs later this year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4fdfaf56-d3fa-4c1a-a642-73959782be8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c2fbb75-d1ae-39cf-a9f7-c8e764c60140",
                        "source_sense_id": "70bc2af2-f4f1-340b-b7fc-1b52afd9735c",
